Objectives of Circular Linked List 

•	To understand the structure and operation of a Circular Linked List.

•	To create coach nodes dynamically using pointers.

•	To insert and delete coach records while preserving the circular link.

•	To search for a coach using its coach number.

•	To display all coaches by stopping when traversal returns to the first node.

•	To count the coaches and release allocated memory safely.
